    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sheehy Meares Real Estate presents to the market this two bedroom, two bathroom bungalow style residence, set on approximately 1.8 acres in the scenic countryside of Menlough, Co. Galway. Presented in turnkey condition throughout, the property combines comfortable living accommodation with extensive grounds and a range of useful outbuildings.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a sitting room to the right with an open fireplace, two double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with an en-suite, and a main bathroom. A living/dining room features a solid fuel range with a back boiler, with a separate kitchen completing the accommodation.\n\nExternally, a concrete driveway surrounds the residence, with a garden area to the front. The grounds extend to the rear, where a selection of outbuildings provides ample space for storage and other domestic uses. The generous site offers plenty of scope for gardening and enjoying the outdoor space.\n\nSituated in a peaceful rural setting at Lower Ballagh, the property enjoys access to Mountbellew, Ballinasloe and Galway City, offering a countryside location within reach of shops, schools, services and employment centres.\n\nThe residence benefits from oil-fired central heating, complemented by the solid fuel range with back boiler, and has a BER rating of C. \n\nServices include mains water, a septic tank sewerage system and an ESB connection.\n\nThe residence was built in 1983 \n\nFor further details or to arrange a viewing, contact estate agent Cathal Meares of Sheehy Meares Real Estate."
      },
      {
